# Mechanic: Juggernaut without granted affinity costs its full four generic.
# Forcing: two artifacts and four basic Islands provide exactly its unreduced cost.
# AI behavior: no hand or battlefield, so no opposing choices affect payment.
# Failure modes: discounted payment or a missing cast fails; a hang fails continuation.
# Card roles: two Ornithopters fix artifact count, Juggernaut consumes four mana.
# Protocol path: Cast offer and response, four ManaPaid rows, resolution and continued land play.
# Paired with: affinity-granted.pzl and affinity-without-golem.pzl.
